{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_1","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"外戚恩澤表","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_2","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"古恩澤封有三，曰外戚，曰中官，曰嬖倖。明興，追崇外氏，廟貌之隆，爵超五等，而苗裔無攷，未及授官。高后外家不奉朝請，家法之嚴有自來矣。自文皇后而外，率由儒族單門，入儷宸極。后父初秩不過指揮，侯伯保傅以漸而進。優者厚田宅，列僮奴。雖擁侈富之資，曾無憑藉之勢，制防之微意寓焉。肅宗申明功令，裁抑世封，戚畹周親不得與汗馬餘勳為齒。雖稱肺腑，事劣封君。上視漢、唐，殆相懸絕。茲考實錄所載封襲歲月，備列為表，以別於元功之次。他若宦官子弟濫列金貂，方士義兒均從班爵，騁文成之丕誕，踵養子之傾輈，亂政亟行，若循一軌，各依年次，備著於篇，亦班固表外戚，譜張釋、欒大之例也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_3","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"始封","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_4","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"曾孫","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_5","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"五世","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_6","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"六世","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_7","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"七世","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_8","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"八世","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_9","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"九世","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_10","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"十世","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_11","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"恩親侯","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_12","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"李貞","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_13","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"尚太祖姊孝親公主。洪武元年二月庚午封。後以子文忠功，進封曹國公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_14","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"揚王","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_15","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"陳公","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_16","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"逸其名，太祖母淳皇后父。洪武二年追贈。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_17","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"徐王","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_18","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"馬公","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_19","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"逸其名，高皇后父。洪武二年追贈。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_20","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"惠義侯","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_21","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"劉繼祖","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_22","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"太祖同里人。以與淳皇帝葬地，洪武十一年九月丙申追封。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_23","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"彭城伯","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_24","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張麒","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_25","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"昭皇后父，永樂九年七月辛酉追封伯。仁宗即位，十一月壬申追贈侯。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_26","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"{日永}","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_27","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"仁宗即位封，世襲。正統三年六月卒。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_28","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正統三年十月乙卯襲。成化十六年四月卒。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_29","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"成化十七年十二月丁卯襲。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_30","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德三年十月甲戌襲。嘉靖十七年二月壬子卒。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_31","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉靖十七年八月丙辰襲。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_32","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉靖三十年六月壬戌襲，右府僉書。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_33","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"守忠","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_34","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"萬曆中襲，三十八年，後府僉書。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_35","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉猷","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_36","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"萬曆四十年十二月辛亥襲。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_37","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"光祖","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_38","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"崇禎元年七月庚申襲。十二年四月，左府僉書。城陷，死於賊。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_39","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"保昌伯","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_40","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"蔣廷珪","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_41","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"仁宗乳母夫。仁宗即位，十一月追封。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_42","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"會昌伯","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_43","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"孫忠","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_44","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"恭皇后父。宣德四年三月辛亥封，世襲。景泰三年九月卒。贈侯，諡康靖。天順元年贈安國公，改諡恭憲。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_45","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"會昌侯","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_46","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"繼宗","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_47","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"天順元年正月辛卯進世侯，加太傅，掌後府。成化十五年十一月卒。贈郯國公，諡榮襄。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_48","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"成化十六年襲。弘治十四年三月，五軍營管操。正德元年二月，奮武營管操。四年總神機營，屢掌軍府。十五年三月卒。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_49","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德十六年二月襲。嘉靖二年九月坐耀武營管操。十二年九月充五軍營右哨坐營。十六年十月卒。諡榮僖。以革外戚封除。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_50","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"惠安伯","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_51","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張昇","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_52","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"麒子，{日永}弟。正統五年封，世襲。六年正月卒。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_53","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正統六年七月壬子襲。成化三年八月卒。無子。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_54","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"襲，未幾卒。無子。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_55","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"瑛庶兄。成化十六年三月庚寅襲。弘治六年十月卒。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_56","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"弘治七年三月己亥襲。十二年鎮陝西，召還。十三年八月領左府。正德三年十二月提督團營，幷三千營管操。嘉靖十四年六月卒。贈太傅，諡康靖。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_57","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉靖十七年四月丙午襲，屢典營務。二十九年正月丁丑卒。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_58","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"元善","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_59","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"鑭從子。嘉靖三十四年二月辛巳襲。萬曆三十七年六月己未卒。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_60","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"慶臻","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_61","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"萬曆三十七年十一月癸巳襲。崇禎元年七月己巳總京營。十月己亥革京營總督，聽議。十七年城陷，闔家自焚死。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_62","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"安平伯","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_63","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"吳安","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_64","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"景帝母吳太后兄。景泰中封。天順元年二月除。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_65","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"昭武伯","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_66","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"曹欽","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_67","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"內臣曹吉祥嗣子。天順元年十二月以吉祥奪門功封。五年七月謀反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_68","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"慶雲侯","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_69","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"周能","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_70","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"憲宗母孝肅太后父。成化四年四月甲午追封。十七年十二月加贈寧國公，諡榮靖。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_71","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"成化三年十一月乙亥封慶雲伯。四年予世襲。十七年十二月進封侯。弘治元年加祿百石。正德四年二月卒。贈宣國公，諡恭和。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_72","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德四年六月己卯襲，後以例除。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_73","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"安昌伯","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_74","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"錢承宗","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_75","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"睿皇后弟鍾孫。成化十五年正月庚辰封。弘治二年四月予世襲。嘉靖四年閏十二月卒。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_76","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"維圻","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_77","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉靖五年八月乙卯襲，後以例除。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_78","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"瑞安侯","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_79","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"王源","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_80","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"純皇后弟。成化二十年十一月封伯，世襲。弘治元年加祿百石。六年追封源父鎮阜國公，進源爵侯。嘉靖三年七月丁卯卒。贈太師，諡榮靖。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_81","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"嘉靖三年十一月丁丑襲伯，後以例除。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_82","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"長寧伯","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_83","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"周彧","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_84","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"能子，壽弟。成化二十一年封，世襲。弘治元年加祿百石。正德三年十二月卒。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_85","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德四年二月襲。十四年三月卒。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_86","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"大經","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_87","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德十四年七月襲。嘉靖三十八年六月甲子卒。以例除。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_88","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"壽寧侯","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_89","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張巒","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_90","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"敬皇后父，弘治四年二月己未封伯，五年三月進侯，八月卒。贈昌國公，諡莊肅。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_91","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"鶴齡","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_92","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"弘治五年十一月襲。嘉靖元年三月加太師。二年八月庚子進昌國公。十二年十月丙子以罪除。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_93","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"建昌侯","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_94","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張延齡","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_95","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"巒子，鶴齡弟。弘治八年四月乙丑封伯。十六年九月進侯。嘉靖元年三月加太傅。十二年十月丙子下獄論死，爵除。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_96","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"崇善伯","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_97","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"王清","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_98","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"源弟。弘治十年封。十一年三月予世襲。嘉靖十三年卒。以例除。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_99","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"安仁伯","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_100","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"王濬","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_101","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"清弟。正德二年封。十月丁卯卒。贈侯。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_102","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"正德三年襲。嘉靖中以例除。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_103","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"慶陽伯","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_104","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"夏儒","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_105","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"毅皇后父。正德二年封，世襲。追贈三代。十年四月丁未卒。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_106","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"世臣","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_107","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"一名臣。正德十六年襲。嘉靖二年八月加太子太保。八年以例除。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_108","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"永定伯","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_109","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"朱泰","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_110","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"本姓許。正德中，以義子賜姓封。十六年除。永定伯朱泰本姓許正德中以義子賜姓封，十六年除。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_111","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"泰安伯","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_112","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張富","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_113","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"內臣張永弟。正德五年九月己未封。十六年除。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_114","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"安定伯","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_115","chapterId":"ch_work_minh_su_108","textTraditional":"張容","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_minh_su_108_116","chapterId":"ch_work_m